VALUES ('doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p35-15', 'doc-04-nist-sp-800-86', '', 35, 'These are referred to as clusters by some filesystems (e.g., File Allocation Table [FAT], NT File System [NTFS]) and as blocks by other filesystems (e.g., UNIX and Linux).', 'kb-doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p35-15', 0, 28, '04-nist-sp-800-86', 'retrieved', 'DE7A62B8536D3E08D3FF8242D4E31816293FE5777C84A42B6D4A54E3EC816F95', 'v1', '{"source_id": "04-nist-sp-800-86", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
