VALUES ('doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p38-13', 'doc-04-nist-sp-800-86', '', 38, 'Besides the steps that were taken to record the image, the analyst should document supplementary information such as the hard drive model and serial number, media storage capacity, and information about the imaging software or hardware that was used (e.g., name, version number, licensing information).', 'kb-doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p38-13', 0, 45, '04-nist-sp-800-86', 'retrieved', 'BBA236842E04B80FB76D70AF4C46A9357707B376F8C1921842840F6D981F60F2', 'v1', '{"source_id": "04-nist-sp-800-86", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
